...imports a non-existent export. This will fail typecheck (TS2305) and build. The task block says: "Frozen external contracts you consume (do not edit these files): ... getAuthoredUpsellClose(chart, variant) (R12-D signature below)". And the Accept clause: "parent typecheck exits 0". The R12-A changelog entry says "final acceptance still gated on R12-D landing getAuthoredUpsellClose in src/services/authoredChartExplanations.ts plus parent integration typecheck."

